+/* SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later */
+/*
+ * Copyright (C) 2026, serlk
+ *
+ * Pipeline handler for the MediaTek MT6878 RAW/YUV engines driven by a
+ * replayed command queue (kernel driver mtk-camraw-mt6878).
+ *
+ * The driver delivers the processed picture of one fixed sensor mode as
+ * NV21, with the ISP settings of a captured request. It has a media device
+ * of its own with one video node; the sensor and the sensor interface that
+ * feed it belong to the media device of the CAMSV engine of the same CSI
+ * port, found by the name the video node gives its input. The camera is
+ * offered only when the driver has loaded its captured requests (the node
+ * reports a picture format); without them the CAMSV media device stays
+ * free for the simple pipeline handler and its software ISP.
+ *
+ * Exposure is controlled by the mtkcamraw IPA from a luma histogram of the
+ * delivered pictures.
+ */
+
